{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"9b2f9cf64d4051ff163f1bd674ad47c0d83645f69baec0265e003e7ad11b0e4e","ja":"声のする方へ","zh":"循声而去","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"82923ddac169287c6ea1a4ae1ae6a213b8a8f54a04b58c9e0b76f06f57138f5c","ja":"エミリーは謎の女の子に手を引かれ続けていた……","zh":"艾米莉一直被神秘的女孩牵着手……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d6bb7319e4c0bf96bab2cdc7f7072639958eaecf06e6b8d02f40803404c75ee9","ja":"「この場所もとってもステキでしょう？」","zh":"“这个地方也特别棒对吧？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"beb00c980fb2c35d129cfb2fa3c679dd1e8daa3e6fbb5ed236fd41bd9c81cd90","ja":"は、はい。ですがもう帰らなければ……あれ？\n私は、どこに帰れば……？","zh":"好、好的。但我该回去了……咦？\n我该回到哪里去呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c7389ea0acad94d305fc6dcfc3c92ca35344cca400b21fc633c796391656fd93","ja":"「気にしないで。あなたはずーっと、\n私についてくればいいんだよ♪」","zh":"「别介意。你只要一直、\n一直跟着我就好啦♪」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9d681be6268b9c9ee299fc072c48ea9cec548effc2edb995a3aceae7c904416c","ja":"（そうですね。私はこの子についていけば……。\nでも何か、大切なことを忘れているような気が……）","zh":"（是啊。我只要跟着这个孩子走就……。\n但总觉得，自己好像忘记了什么重要的事情……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"4eb274dc84bd23e57ab71c21ad10154cef872a38f11be1d432c4ebd7995ff26b","ja":"エミリーーーー！　お～～～～いっ！","zh":"艾米莉————！喂～～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"89addfc02a2f378d80c1df3aa1728f74b12d248e9c12c1184480424e3b7eb524","ja":"！？　今のは……昴さんの声……！\nそうでした、私は……！！","zh":"！？　刚才那是……昴的声音……！\n对了，我……！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1b6908963f2174c72c5ab5dd2071aa0d9a37f7e7ce7ca786b81f5424b6a6cdcc","ja":"すみません！　戻らないと……！　私は昴さんと\n亜美さんと志保さんと、歌と踊りのお稽古に……！","zh":"对不起！我得回去了……！我还得和昴小姐、\n亚美小姐以及志保小姐一起练习唱歌和跳舞……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c03117ce3485a0d3789a8e4c99cd47ef121eed93e49dcb68926b362f7825d7c6","ja":"「えっ……！　歌……踊り……\nあなた、もしかして巫女なの！？」","zh":"「诶……！　唱歌……跳舞……\n你难道是巫女吗！？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"b597060ceab2a8faca61534e86f14850da4b54b6a05f72de81a873f4dcb43dca","ja":"「じゃあ……連れていけない！\n一緒に行けないじゃない……！」","zh":"「那……就不能带你去了！\n不就不能一起去了吗……！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"1dd466e6c4fd132208cba3f0eb0a1779d09f3268271c4bdd2a85ef35b25ce554","ja":"えっ……！？　あ、あの……！？","zh":"诶……！？　那、那个……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"db4855fe57f02f0d659e18e1d728856cac62efb58eb80e64e803afb79a8a905c","ja":"……あ、あれっ！　ここは……。","zh":"……哎、哎呀！　这里是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"4d3eff02e21d4165444027d507ff96787162e163c1b4307dc0aba13a50fc8255","ja":"エミリー！　大丈夫か！？","zh":"艾米莉！你没事吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"11c18fab813152db94d0e67cff0758a012333dbadd54e4a75f0e716c29f24662","ja":"みんなで手分けして、このあたりずっと探してたんだ！\nどこ行ってたんだよ？","zh":"大家分头行动，在这附近找了你好久！\n你到底去哪儿了啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"a4835ea9a722e6be63055cd95b22375aac85b769cddaa889c34184fa2b9ae483","ja":"ええと……私は、女の子と移動しているうちに……\n帰り道が、わからなくなってしまって……。","zh":"那个……我跟一个女孩子走着走着……\n就不知道回去的路该怎么走了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"4312523f4bd2c388ce3aa77ab7ef996febff79b5ed4fd55168bf829cb82acab1","ja":"女の子？　エミリーはひとりでどっかに\n行っちゃったみたいだったけど……。　","zh":"女孩子？艾米莉好像一个人\n跑到什么地方去了就是了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"c0b3ecb8f7b730ec252c35a8b7152122a9d959fc255bdc8744a5db22ad7dd0fe","ja":"亜美が言ってたみたいに、本当に\n伝説の神隠しにあったのかな……！？","zh":"真像亚美说的那样，真的\n遭遇了传说的神隐吗……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"ebc18c6bc7105fa63feb0425c27a883dfd2e763eb8f4ff4d93734b46b9bb4328","ja":"神隠し……？　そういえばあの子は、別れる前に\n「一緒に行けない」と言っていました……。","zh":"神隐……？　这么说来那个孩子在分别前\n曾说过「不能一起去」……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"e1fc82b9706e4717f8d7a03e9fb7766576a5c5044b0ba34e40c4ec197b533e67","ja":"ギリギリセーフだったってことじゃん！？\nぶ、無事に帰ってこれてよかったよ……！","zh":"这不是千钧一发才勉强赶上的吗！？\n能、能平安回来真是太好了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"beaa30b62cece6874ed895a9fe019c5b9646a239b331e764a075cf3e41188b36","ja":"はい！　歌と踊りのお稽古があるとお話ししたら、\nすぐにわかっていただけたようでした……！","zh":"是的！我一说是要去上唱歌和跳舞的课，\n对方好像就立刻理解了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1076.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"3b3cf540b9d72180acd84f365e873f03be1b938184ecf81e3eac87be2943a2fa","ja":"やはり、大和撫子は素晴らしいですね。\n神隠しからも、身を守れるのですから♪","zh":"大和抚子果然非常了不起呢。\n毕竟就连面对神隐，也能保护好自己呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
